# Environment Configuration for iOS Authentication App
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values

# Clerk Authentication Configuration  
# Get this key from your Clerk dashboard: https://dashboard.clerk.dev/
# Create a new application and copy the "Publishable Key"
EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_your_publishable_key_here

# Development Notes:
# - This is the only required environment variable for the app to function
# - The EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix makes this variable available in the client-side code
# - Publishable keys are safe to use in client-side applications
# - Keep your Clerk Secret Key in your server environment, not here
